    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφᾰγεῖν</span></b> , serving as aor. 2 to
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεσθίω</span> (q. v.); 
			Dor.
		
		inf. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆμεν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Epich.
			42.4
		</span></i>: later fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταφάγομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ki.</u>
					12.24m
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PIand.</u>
				26.23
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i>Gloss.:—devour, eat up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὰρ ἐπεὶ κατὰ τέκν᾽ ἔφαγε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.317
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.141
			</span></i> (tm.), <i><span class="en">
				3.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				352
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spend in eating, waste</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή τοι κατὰ πάντα φάγωσι κτήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.315
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				15.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν πατρῴαν οὐσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.96
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρῴαν γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					349.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
